eason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110513","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110513.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110513.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Changes:\r\n* Fix: Slider background size.\r\n* Add: New hint `prefer_arrows` for float editing, complementing the existing `prefer_slider` hint for integers.\r\n* Full RTL layout support.\r\n* Fix scaling issues for slider grabber.\r\n* Make sure text draw position always matches the `LineEdit` text position.\r\n* Fix unable to move the mouse after changing the value with mouse wheel up/down while grabbing the slider grabber.\r\n* Add up and down icons similar to SpinBox and allow right clicking them to set value to max/min.\r\n* Remove an extra `Control` node used as the parent of the internal `LineEdit` which is no longer needed.\r\n* Added proper theme cache properties instead of using get_theme* inside the class.\r\n* Refactor: Removed the `control_state` property (which previously controlled slider/arrow visibility and the integer-only `prefer_slider` flag). Introduced clearer, more descriptive properties, `hide_control`, `integer_prefer_slider` and `float_prefer_arrows`. Note: `ControlState` remains internally to tell if we are currently using slider or arrows for both floats and integers.\r\n* <s> Add symmetric fill support, useful for Control.rotation property. </s> Will be added in another PR following this.\r\n\r\nI have made a project to easily test EditorSpinSlider changes.\r\n\r\nNote: Updated the test project to work with the latest changes from this PR:\r\n[spin-slider-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22585582/spin-slider-test.zip)\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110513/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused"